<!-- 我的售后（v5「字重」稿 B4）：24 大标题 + 倒车进场的小货车 + 售后记录行（状态灯/金币 + 标题 + 状态 + 说明 + 查看订单）；底部 联系客服。
     数据源 getMyAfterSales·状态语义不变；游标分页(onReachBottom)/失败重试(onRetryLoad)/查看订单(onTapOrder)/按住撤回(onWithdrawStart/Move/End)/客服(onKefu) 承接 aftersales.ts。 -->
<v5-nav title="我的售后" />

<view class="as">
  <text class="as-title">售后记录</text>

  <block wx:if="{{list.length}}">
    <view class="as-truck"><px-truck pose="reverse" arrive="160" cargo="1" /></view>
    <view class="as-list">
      <view class="as-row" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="as-ico">
          <!-- 设计稿 AS_ST：已同意＝金币（退款在路上）、申请中＝紫灯、已退款＝绿灯、已拒绝＝灰灯无光晕 -->
          <px-anim wx:if="{{item.status === 'approved'}}" class="as-coin" name="coin" size="2" />
          <px-i wx:elif="{{item.status === 'applied'}}" name="led" tone="var(--v5-violet)" />
          <px-i wx:elif="{{item.status === 'refunded'}}" name="led" tone="var(--v5-ok)" />
          <px-i wx:else name="led" tone="rgba(17,17,17,.28)" halo="none" />
        </view>
        <view class="as-mid">
          <view class="as-top">
            <text class="as-name">{{item.name}}{{item.spec ? '（' + item.spec + '）' : ''}}</text>
            <text class="t-sys as-st as-st-{{item.status}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text>
          </view>
          <!-- 已拒绝/已撤回没退钱：金额叫「申请金额」，不写「退款」免得像退了 -->
          <text class="t-sys as-note">申请于 {{item.appliedAtLabel}} · ×{{item.qty}} · {{item.status === 'rejected' || item.status === 'withdrawn' ? '申请金额' : '退款'}} {{item.refundAmountLabel}}</text>
          <text class="t-sys as-note" wx:if="{{item.reason}}">原因：{{item.reason}}</text>
          <text class="t-sys as-note" wx:if="{{item.status === 'rejected' && item.rejectReason}}">拒绝原因：{{item.rejectReason}}</text>
          <!-- 申请中：按住 700ms 撤回（浅色键红字·轻点提示「按住撤回申请」·挪开 10px 作废，同订单页按住取消） -->
          <view wx:if="{{item.canWithdraw}}" class="as-wd" data-i="{{index}}" bind:touchstart="onWithdrawStart" bind:touchmove="onWithdrawMove" bind:touchend="onWithdrawEnd" bind:touchcancel="onWithdrawEnd">
            <view class="k k-sm k-light as-wd-k {{holdId === item.id ? 'as-hold-on' : ''}}" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-light-down" hover-stay-time="100"
              data-k="light" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp"><view class="as-fill"></view><text class="as-wd-t">撤回申请</text></view>
          </view>
          <view class="t-sys as-link" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-row-down" data-id="{{item.orderId}}" bind:tap="onTapOrder">
            <text>查看订单</text>
            <px-i name="arrow" />
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="t-sys as-loading as-more" wx:if="{{paging}}"><px-anim name="loader" size="2" /><text>加载中</text></view>
    <view class="t-sys as-more" wx:elif="{{hasMore}}">上拉加载更多</view>
    <view class="t-sys as-more" wx:else>没有更多了</view>
  </block>

  <!-- 骨架占位（首次加载中间空白·根因#8）：不误报空态 -->
  <block wx:if="{{loading && !list.length}}">
    <view class="t-sys as-loading"><px-anim name="loader" size="2" /><text>加载中</text></view>
    <view class="as-skel" wx:for="{{[1, 2, 3]}}" wx:key="*this">
      <view class="as-skel-bar skel" style="width: 96px"></view>
      <view class="as-skel-row">
        <view class="as-skel-thumb skel"></view>
        <view class="as-skel-col">
          <view class="as-skel-bar skel" style="width: 60%"></view>
          <view class="as-skel-bar skel" style="width: 36%"></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <!-- 失败态与空态分治（根因#14·守卫 rw-mp-list-loadfailed-state） -->
  <view class="as-state" wx:if="{{!loading && loadFailed}}">
    <view class="as-signal"><px-anim name="signal" size="4" /></view>
    <text class="as-state-t">网络开小差</text>
    <text class="t-sys as-note">售后记录没加载出来，请重试</text>
    <view class="k k-light as-retry" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-light-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onRetryLoad" data-k="light" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">重试</view>
  </view>
  <view class="as-state" wx:elif="{{!loading && !list.length}}">
    <view class="as-box"><px-ground kind="box" /></view>
    <text class="as-state-t">还没有售后记录</text>
  </view>
  <view class="as-dock-space"></view>
</view>

<view class="as-dock">
  <view class="k k-light k-48 as-cs" hover-start-time="20" hover-class="k-light-down" hover-stay-time="100" bind:tap="onKefu" data-k="light" bind:touchstart="onKeyDown" bind:touchend="onKeyUp">联系客服</view>
</view>
